 **Data Structures:**
-- `deltaX`, `deltaY`, `deltaZ`: Arrays of size 256 (for 8-bit coordinates), storing `int32_t` offsets. The value at index $i$ is the Morton index difference between voxel $i+1$ and voxel $i$ along that axis [S1, unofficial].
